---
layout: "base.njk"
title: "Kunststof op maat | Blokken, platen, stroken en ringen"
description: "Kunststof op maat laten maken? Wij leveren kunststof blokken, stroken, platen, ringen en volledig bewerkte kunststof onderdelen. Van enkelstuks tot grotere series."
image: "/assets/images/kunststof-blokken-andere-hoek.webp"
imageAlt: "Kunststof blokken en technische onderdelen op maat"
bodyClass: "mkh-home"
---

{% set contactEmail = site.email or "offerte@maatwerkkunststof.nl" %}

<style>
  body.mkh-home {
    --mkh-ink: #14262e;
    --mkh-text: #54636a;
    --mkh-muted: #78858b;
    --mkh-line: #dce2e3;
    --mkh-soft: #f5f7f6;
    --mkh-white: #ffffff;
    --mkh-orange: #e65b28;
    --mkh-orange-dark: #c8481b;
    --mkh-whatsapp: rgb(116 194 0 / 1);
    --mkh-whatsapp-dark: #5c9b00;
    --mkh-radius: 12px;
    --mkh-container: 1180px;
    background: var(--mkh-white);
  }

  body.mkh-home main {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .mkh-container {
    width: min(calc(100% - 32px), var(--mkh-container));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .mkh-section {
    padding: 68px 0;
  }

  .mkh-section-soft {
    background: var(--mkh-soft);
  }

  .mkh-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: var(--mkh-orange);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .mkh-heading {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 760;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .mkh-section-intro {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .mkh-section-intro > p {
    max-width: 660px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .mkh-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 50px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--mkh-orange);
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 13px 20px;
    color: var(--mkh-white);
    background: var(--mkh-orange);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 760;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mkh-btn:hover,
  .mkh-btn:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--mkh-orange-dark);
    background: var(--mkh-orange-dark);
  }

  .mkh-btn-whatsapp {
    border-color: var(--mkh-whatsapp);
    color: var(--mkh-white);
    background: var(--mkh-whatsapp);
  }

  .mkh-btn-whatsapp:hover,
  .mkh-btn-whatsapp:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--mkh-whatsapp-dark);
    background: var(--mkh-whatsapp-dark);
  }

  .mkh-link {
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 760;
    text-decoration-color: var(--mkh-orange);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  /* Hero */

  .mkh-hero {
    padding: 46px 0 58px;
    background: var(--mkh-white);
  }

  .mkh-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 36px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .mkh-hero-copy {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .mkh-hero h1 {
    max-width: 790px;
    margin: 0 0 21px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 790;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .mkh-hero-lead {
    max-width: 670px;
    margin: 0 0 25px;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.03rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .mkh-hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .mkh-hero-points {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 22px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .mkh-hero-points li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 19px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .mkh-hero-points li::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.58em;
    left: 0;
    width: 10px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--mkh-orange);
    content: "";
  }

  .mkh-hero-image {
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
    border-radius: var(--mkh-radius);
    padding: 18px;
    background: var(--mkh-soft);
  }

  .mkh-hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  /* Product cards */

  .mkh-product-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .mkh-product-card {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
    border-radius: var(--mkh-radius);
    background: var(--mkh-white);
  }

  .mkh-product-image {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    padding: 14px;
    background: var(--mkh-soft);
  }

  .mkh-product-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .mkh-product-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 21px;
  }

  .mkh-product-copy h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .mkh-product-copy h3 a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .mkh-product-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.58;
  }

  .mkh-product-copy .mkh-link {
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  /* Simple image and copy sections */

  .mkh-split {
    display: grid;
    gap: 34px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .mkh-square-image {
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
    border-radius: var(--mkh-radius);
    padding: 16px;
    background: var(--mkh-soft);
  }

  .mkh-square-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .mkh-split-copy p {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .mkh-simple-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 10px 20px;
    margin: 25px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .mkh-simple-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 21px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 680;
  }

  .mkh-simple-list li::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.57em;
    left: 0;
    width: 10px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--mkh-orange);
    content: "";
  }

  /* Material table */

  .mkh-material-table {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
    border-radius: var(--mkh-radius);
    background: var(--mkh-white);
  }

  .mkh-material-row {
    display: grid;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 19px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
  }

  .mkh-material-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .mkh-material-row-head {
    display: none;
  }

  .mkh-material-row p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.58;
  }

  .mkh-material-name strong,
  .mkh-material-name span {
    display: block;
  }

  .mkh-material-name strong {
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .mkh-material-name span {
    color: var(--mkh-muted);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
  }

  .mkh-material-processing {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .mkh-material-processing::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.67em;
    left: 0;
    width: 9px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--mkh-orange);
    content: "";
  }

  .mkh-material-footer {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
    border-radius: var(--mkh-radius);
    padding: 21px;
    background: var(--mkh-soft);
  }

  .mkh-material-footer strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
  }

  .mkh-material-footer p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Examples */

  .mkh-example-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .mkh-example-card {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
    border-radius: var(--mkh-radius);
    background: var(--mkh-white);
  }

  .mkh-example-card figure {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 14px;
    background: var(--mkh-soft);
  }

  .mkh-example-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .mkh-example-copy {
    padding: 18px 20px 20px;
  }

  .mkh-example-copy h3 {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .mkh-example-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Applications */

  .mkh-application-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .mkh-application-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 21px;
    background: var(--mkh-white);
  }

  .mkh-application-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 7px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .mkh-application-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Process */

  .mkh-process-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .mkh-process-card {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--mkh-orange);
    padding: 21px 0 0;
  }

  .mkh-process-number {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--mkh-orange);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .mkh-process-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 7px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .mkh-process-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* SEO text */

  .mkh-seo-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .mkh-seo-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 17px;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  /* FAQ */

  .mkh-faq-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .mkh-faq-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
  }

  .mkh-faq-list details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
  }

  .mkh-faq-list summary {
    position: relative;
    padding: 19px 38px 19px 0;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 730;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .mkh-faq-list summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .mkh-faq-list summary::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 15px;
    right: 3px;
    color: var(--mkh-orange);
    content: "+";
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .mkh-faq-list details[open] summary::after {
    content: "−";
  }

  .mkh-faq-list p {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding-right: 25px;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Simple quote form */

  .mkh-quote {
    padding: 72px 0;
    background: var(--mkh-soft);
  }

  .mkh-quote-wrap {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .mkh-quote-heading {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .mkh-quote-heading p:last-child {
    margin: 15px auto 0;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .mkh-form {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--mkh-line);
    border-radius: var(--mkh-radius);
    padding: 20px;
    background: var(--mkh-white);
  }

  .mkh-form-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .mkh-field {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .mkh-field label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 7px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 730;
  }

  .mkh-field input,
  .mkh-field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid #cbd3d5;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 12px 13px;
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    background: var(--mkh-white);
  }

  .mkh-field input {
    min-height: 48px;
  }

  .mkh-field textarea {
    min-height: 170px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .mkh-field input:focus,
  .mkh-field textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--mkh-orange);
    outline: 3px solid rgba(230, 91, 40, 0.16);
  }

  .mkh-field-help,
  .mkh-form-note {
    margin: 7px 0 0;
    color: var(--mkh-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .mkh-checkbox {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 20px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: start;
    margin: 2px 0 18px;
    color: var(--mkh-text);
    font-size: 0.79rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .mkh-checkbox input {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    accent-color: var(--mkh-orange);
  }

  .mkh-checkbox a {
    color: var(--mkh-ink);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .mkh-form-status {
    display: none;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 11px 13px;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
  }

  .mkh-form-status.is-error,
  .mkh-form-status.is-success {
    display: block;
  }

  .mkh-form-status.is-error {
    color: #7b2525;
    background: #fdecec;
  }

  .mkh-form-status.is-success {
    color: #14583b;
    background: #e6f6ee;
  }

  .mkh-form .mkh-btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .mkh-form-note {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .mkh-honeypot {
    position: absolute !important;
    width: 1px !important;
    height: 1px !important;
    margin: -1px !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    overflow: hidden !important;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0) !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    border: 0 !important;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .mkh-container {
      width: min(calc(100% - 48px), var(--mkh-container));
    }

    .mkh-product-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .mkh-example-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .mkh-application-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .mkh-process-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .mkh-form-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .mkh-hero {
      padding: 72px 0 82px;
    }

    .mkh-hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns:
        minmax(0, 1.08fr)
        minmax(420px, 0.92fr);
      gap: 76px;
    }

    .mkh-section,
    .mkh-quote {
      padding-block: 94px;
    }

    .mkh-section-intro {
      grid-template-columns:
        minmax(0, 1fr)
        minmax(330px, 0.72fr);
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .mkh-product-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .mkh-product-copy {
      min-height: 220px;
    }

    .mkh-split {
      grid-template-columns:
        minmax(400px, 0.85fr)
        minmax(0, 1.15fr);
      gap: 76px;
    }

    .mkh-material-row {
      grid-template-columns:
        minmax(150px, 0.55fr)
        minmax(0, 1.4fr)
        minmax(220px, 0.9fr);
      gap: 26px;
      align-items: start;
      padding: 20px 24px;
    }

    .mkh-material-row-head {
      display: grid;
      color: var(--mkh-white);
      background: var(--mkh-ink);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
    }

    .mkh-material-row-head strong {
      color: var(--mkh-white);
    }

    .mkh-material-footer {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .mkh-application-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .mkh-seo-grid,
    .mkh-faq-grid {
      grid-template-columns:
        minmax(0, 0.72fr)
        minmax(0, 1.28fr);
      gap: 80px;
    }

    .mkh-form {
      padding: 30px;
    }
  }
/* Afbeeldingen volledig vierkant vullen zonder grijze rand */

.mkh-hero-image,
.mkh-product-image,
.mkh-square-image,
.mkh-example-card figure {
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: var(--mkh-radius);
  background: transparent;
}

.mkh-hero-image img,
.mkh-product-image img,
.mkh-square-image img,
.mkh-example-card img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 0;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;
  transform: scale(1.02);
}
</style>

<section class="mkh-hero" aria-labelledby="mkh-hero-title">
  <div class="mkh-container mkh-hero-grid">
    <div class="mkh-hero-copy">
      <p class="mkh-eyebrow">Kunststof maatwerk</p>

      <h1 id="mkh-hero-title">
        Kunststof op maat voor iedere toepassing
      </h1>

      <p class="mkh-hero-lead">
        Wij leveren kunststof blokken, stroken, platen, ringen en volledig
        bewerkte onderdelen. Van één eenvoudig maatdeel tot grotere
        productieseries.
      </p>

      <div class="mkh-hero-actions">
        <a
          class="mkh-btn"
          href="#offerte"
          data-analytics="quote_cta"
          data-location="home_hero"
        >
          Vraag een offerte aan
        </a>

        {% if site.whatsapp %}
          <a
            class="mkh-btn mkh-btn-whatsapp"
            href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}?text=Hallo%2C%20ik%20wil%20graag%20kunststof%20op%20maat%20laten%20maken."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            data-analytics="whatsapp_click"
            data-location="home_hero"
          >
            WhatsApp
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <ul class="mkh-hero-points">
        <li>Enkelstuks en series</li>
        <li>Vrijwel iedere kunststof</li>
        <li>Volledig op maat bewerkt</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <figure class="mkh-hero-image">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/kunststof-blokken-andere-hoek.webp"
        width="900"
        height="900"
        alt="Kunststof blokken en plaatdelen op maat"
        fetchpriority="high"
      >
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mkh-section" aria-labelledby="mkh-products-title">
  <div class="mkh-container">
    <div class="mkh-section-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="mkh-eyebrow">Producten op maat</p>

        <h2 class="mkh-heading" id="mkh-products-title">
          Wat wilt u laten maken?
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        Kies de productgroep die het beste bij uw aanvraag past. Ook
        afwijkende vormen en volledig bewerkte onderdelen zijn mogelijk.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mkh-product-grid">
      <article class="mkh-product-card">
        <a
          class="mkh-product-image"
          href="/kunststof-blokken-op-maat/"
          aria-label="Bekijk kunststof blokken op maat"
        >
          <img
            src="/assets/images/kunststof-blokken.webp"
            width="700"
            height="700"
